brotli_fast
===========

This package is an independent Dart implementation of the Brotli compression
format (RFC 7932).

It includes data and algorithm-derived tables from the Google Brotli reference
implementation:

  https://github.com/google/brotli
  Copyright Google Inc.
  Licensed under the MIT License.

Specifically:
  * c/common/dictionary.bin (the RFC 7932 static dictionary, 122,784 bytes)
  * c/common/context.c  (the 2048-byte context lookup table)
  * transform tables and format constants derived from the reference Java/C
    decoder and encoder.

The test corpus under test/testdata is copied from the same repository's
tests/testdata directory (MIT).

The implementation is derived from brotli_neo
(https://github.com/gmpassos/dart_brotli, MIT).

The full MIT license text is in LICENSE.
